  "texto": " Hello, welcome to our company. I'm Jorge Marín, the head of IT. Let's start the interview for the software tester job. What is your full name? Hello George, nice to meet you. My full name is Samuel Mercer, but you can call me Sam. Great Sam, how are you? I am 29 years old. Ok, and what is your email and phone number? My email is sammerk at uknet dot t and my phone number is 03069 990232 Perfect, where do you drive? I live at 14 Cloverfold Avenue, South Zantum Good. Now, let's talk about your education. What did you study? I finished secondary school and vocational training. I also have software testing certification. Excellent. What language do you speak? My native language is Spanish but I also speak French and advanced English Very good Do you have work experience Yes I work as a software developer at Silvi video games for two years and in IT support at Thomson Medical Equipment for three years. That is impressive. Who do you describe your personality and skills? I am vicious, responsible and organized. I I work well in a team and motivated others for skills I know C++, Java and Excel. You have a great profile. Do you have any question for me about the job? Yes please. What are the working hours? The hours are Monday to Friday from 9 am to 5 pm. That sounds good. And what is the starting salary? The starting salary is 28,500 per year. Great! What about holiday leave and paid sick leave? You have 20 years of holiday leave per year and 10 of paid sick leave. Thank you very much, George. Everything is very clear. Have a nice day too. Bye!",
